reagent-name-activated-algae = activated algae
reagent-desc-activated-algae = A metabolically supercharged algal strain cultivated with highly nutritious feedstock. It has a mild restorative effect.

reagent-name-stabilisation-algae = stabilisation algae
reagent-desc-stabilisation-algae = An algal strain specialized in culling cancerous growths and repairing cellular damage.

reagent-name-reinforcement-algae = reinforcement algae
reagent-desc-reinforcement-algae = An algal strain specialized in reinforcing damaged tissue. Its effects vary with body temperature.

reagent-name-regeneration-algae = regeneration algae
reagent-desc-regeneration-algae = An algal strain specialized in regenerating damaged tissue, particularly burns. Its effects vary with body temperature.

reagent-name-destabilized-algae = destabilized algae
reagent-desc-destabilized-algae = An unstable algal strain caused by protein misfolding, inducing cancerous growths throughout the body. It is formed when regeneration and reinforcement algae are metabolised at the same time.

reagent-name-denatured = denatured proteins
reagent-desc-denatured = Proteins damaged by high heat. Some of their components may still be recoverable.

reagent-name-dormant-organics = dormant organics
reagent-desc-dormant-organics = Trace organic compounds extracted from denatured proteins.

reagent-name-decayed-protein = decayed protein
reagent-desc-decayed-protein = Degraded protein with little direct use. It can still be centrifuged for useful components.

reagent-name-exotic-algae = exotic algae
reagent-desc-exotic-algae = An unusual algal strain altered by anomalous particulates found in the planet's oil supply.

reagent-name-oxygenated-saline = oxygenated saline
reagent-desc-oxygenated-saline = A saline solution mixed with an algal strain specialized in oxygen production.

reagent-name-algal-feedstock = algal feedstock
reagent-desc-algal-feedstock = A nutrient-rich solution formulated specifically to feed algae.
